{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id954258125"}, "name":{"label":"Exhibit c!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-30T05:09:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.4"}, "id":{"label":"14729353751"}, "title":{"label":"Stop changing!!!"}, "content":{"label":"Hope you're looking for an honest review. Are yall kidding? The tiny Library tab got an even tinier makeover into a profile circle in the top corner. Thumbs Down. And not only are there STILL, NO Playlists pinned on the Home screen, they're harder to reach through this obscure profile button, which I just spent my frustrated sleep energy hunting for! They oughta be prominent, yall. Who enjoys getting up to hit replay or select a new sleep story if they aren't asleep yet? Wait why isn't there a Repeat (1) or (all) switch just like any other media app? Why not a playlist queue to configure? I'm a minimalist user of sleep stories just to get my busy young family to snoozetown, Thank you all for our wonderful sleep aid. ❤️‍🩹", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=571800810&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
